# Conditioning navigation

Open destinations as screens on the conditioning stack. Do not add another navigation library.

These are the only overlay exceptions:

- Create Session chooser
- One workout editor at a time
- Training-emphasis explanation popover
- Discard and end confirmations

The Saved Workouts expander is the only control that may push content down. Other dropdowns stay overlays.

Phone editors fill the space between the header and tabs. Tablet editors are centered, about 90% of the height, with a readable max width. Keep the form scrolling above a fixed footer. Back, Cancel, X, and system Back use the same unsaved-change guard. Visiting a station or emphasis screen must leave the editor draft intact.
